# Kept out of the deployment bundle. Everything here is either rebuilt by the
# build command, irrelevant to serving the demo, or local-only.
#
# No markdown pattern here on purpose. `*.md` would also match
# data/documents/refund_policy.md — the policy document the agent reads — since
# these patterns follow .gitignore semantics, and the few kilobytes of
# root-level markdown are not worth the risk of a subtle exclusion. The
# deployed function needs, at runtime:
#
#   data/seed/*.json                  customer and order facts
#   data/documents/refund_policy.md   what get_refund_policy returns
#   data/demo/scenarios.yaml          which scenarios the page lists
#   data/demo/replays/*.json          the recorded runs
#   evaluations/datasets/*.yaml       the customer messages

backend/.venv/
backend/tests/
frontend/node_modules/
experiments/
evaluations/results/
docs/
skills/
.env
